            "notes": "How Round 2's Add-Ons go all depends on how many deaths you had in Round 1 and how much money you have going into Round 2. \n\nHOWEVER. \n\nOne Add-on is non-negotiable. It doesn't matter if you have to sell something. You need to get Ironclad Exhaust Ports. This is the base framework for every other round. This Add-on is one that you will NOT get rid of. If you can afford it afterwards, you want to buy Angeleisure Wear. With this build, you want to be constantly moving around in the air, so these two Add-ons make it so you're constantly getting Overhealth and also healing.",
