            "notes": "Okay going into Round 3, you shouldn't have many deaths. With Round 3, you want to grab First Responder. This Power is really strong in the right hands. The 250 Overhealth is what we want here.\n\nIf you didn't grab Angeleisure Wear in R2, grab it now. With this add-on, you gain health for movement. Because we're the Immortal Moth, you want to be constantly moving around and flying, becoming unkillable in the sky. \n\nIf you can afford to get another Rare add-on, I like grabbing Icy Coolant here. Icy Coolant will increase your Attack Power (which helps your healing be stronger) and gives you a 5% Cooldown Reduction.",
