            "notes": "R7: this is the last round. You'll be tied with the enemy team but this round is the round that makes the difference. There's a choice of two powers you can choose here. You can get either Serenity OR Thread of Fate. Both are useful and have different uses. If you're dying more, you should grab Serenity. If you need more healing or damage boost, grab Threads of Fate. \n\nFor add-ons, there's not much that you should 100% get. If you can afford, you should grab Hardlight Accelerator for the Weapon Power and Cooldown Reduction. You'll also gain 5% Weapon Power for every time you use an ability (up to 3 times). Otherwise, just grab either Rare or Common survival add-ons until you're either out of money or out of slots.",
